  (79.89/68.10/59.31) on the current publisher Dev 20240627 gold under the
  official evaluator, 30 s budget; the upstream paper reports 74.5. Our locally
  executed adapted-pipeline runs contribute the Pool-D candidate draws only.
  An earlier line here saying "1143 = 74.51% end-to-end run, our model" conflated
